 "remarks": "Welcome to elevated city living in the heart of downtown Stamford. This stunning 2-bedroom luxury high-rise condo offers 1,371 sq ft of sun-filled living space, hardwood floors throughout, designer finishes, and unmatched convenience just minutes from Manhattan.  Perfectly positioned in downtown Stamford, you're a 3-minute walk to 50+ restaurants and bars, steps from CVS, the Avon Theatre and Palace Theatre, and just a 5-minute drive to Metro-North with direct service to NYC.  Residents enjoy exceptional amenities including a heated indoor rooftop pool open year-round, top-floor entertaining lounge with sweeping NYC skyline views, fully equipped fitness center, 24/7 concierge and security, secure package storage, and a private underground garage parking space included with the unit.  Pet lovers will appreciate the brand-new, state-of-the-art private dog park, one of Stamford's most unique building amenities and also a peaceful interior green space for residents and families.  Additional highlights include in-unit laundry with new washer/dryer installed Dec. 2025, pet-friendly policies with few breed restrictions, and close proximity to major hospitals, corporate headquarters, nightlife, shopping, and dining.  Live in the center of it all at 25 Forest St, Apt 6L. Schedule your private showing today.",
